title: Internal Security
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet
on-arrival: police_timer += 6; month_actions += 1
view-if: police_timer <= 0
card-image: img/kmtpolice.jpg

= Internal Security

It is necessary to keep order in our regions and keep our citizens safe from criminals.

- @reform: Reform the Guangzhou police.
- @corruption : Crack down on corruption.
- @back: Leave security alone for now.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@reform
subtitle: -1 funds
choose-if: funds >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough funds.
on-arrival: funds -= 1; police_reform += 1; workers_kmt += 5;

We have successfully reformed the city police, kicking out corrupt officials, funding more equipment and hiring more officers.

@corruption
subtitle: -2 funds
choose-if: corruption > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Corruption is low.
on-arrival: funds -= 2;
go-to: wincorruption if police_reform >= corruption; losecorruption if police_reform < corruption

@wincorruption
on-arrival: corruption -= 1;

We have successfully cracked down on corruption. This is great for our income.

@losecorruption

Unfortunately, our police failed to catch any targets. We should reform our police further.

@back
go-to: root
